icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I came up with some vauge ideas earlier in the thread, if that helps? </div> </div> </div>Yes, it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T13:21:27-07:00","id":1085556,"title":"","content":"Honestly I feel addressing all of the non-core Compacts and Conspiracies is a bit much. Mentioning some is good in a kind of easter egg sort of way, but adding on even small sections might take away from the already good content the supplement already provides. <br /> <br /> If anything, as a love letter to Princess fans it might be worth using that section instead for potential Hunter antagonists in Princess the Hopeful games. Sort of mirroring the antagonist section for Hunter with some sorta-allies and definite enemies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T14:18:53-07:00","id":1085581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If anything, as a love letter to Princess fans it might be worth using that section instead for potential Hunter antagonists in Princess the Hopeful games. Sort of mirroring the antagonist section for Hunter with some sorta-allies and definite enemies. </div> </div> </div>Please clarify what you mean by that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T21:11:19-07:00","id":1085678,"title":"","content":"Basically, use the space that would be used for the expanded Compacts &amp; Conspiracy opinions instead to add example Hunter NPCs like the example Princesses and Spawn. Give them stats and plot hooks, and have each one be involved with the Nobility in some way. For some examples:<br /> <br /> ~ Cold Guard Hunter who runs an AA meeting group and hunts down sorcerers who try to &quot;cure&quot; any of his members before they can find the strength within themselves to stand on their own two feet. <br /> <br /> ~ Union Hunter who wants to rid her neighborhood of all supernatural activity, no exceptions and no compromises. <br /> <br /> ~ #Ammit Hunter who works with a Noble and has begun obsessing about her. She's her avenging angel, and she will do anything to protect her and keep her on the straight and narrow.<br /> <br /> ~ Network Zero Hunter who's turned the exploits of a local Noble into a popular web comic. The city is starting to run out of dangers though, and with this much popularity something must be done to keep it's interest up. <br /> <br /> ~ Crown Jewels Hunter who's infiltrated a Null Mysteriis Cell and has begun directing them towards a local Nest. He wants to see what research he can get done before his lord must be brought in to clear the Nest properly.<br /> <br /> ~ Magisters of the Economy Hunter who's as insufferable as they are politically tricky to deal with. She's made herself indispensable to the local community and no matter how badly she must be stopped if she's taken out now the entire city will feel the fallout. <br /> <br /> So on and so forth. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 04-30-2017, 12:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T00:53:34-07:00","id":1085729,"title":"","content":"... Not necessarly a bad idea, but that would actually take more pages than the extended groups idea^^'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T01:12:19-07:00","id":1085732,"title":"","content":"Those were just some ideas. It would only be a couple of entries. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T13:41:55-07:00","id":1085874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darinas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1085234#post1085234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soooo #Ammit still lack any exemples of Hunters. Anyone has ideas for this?</div> </div> </div> </div>I got one.<br /> <br /> <i>Truth is, you didn't give a rip about the &quot;cause&quot; or any such malarky. You were generally what #Ammit is afraid of letting into their clique-you were, and to an extend are, an impish little troll, and proud of it-you thought that being part of the hacker gang was a good way to piss people off who nobody really minded upsetting. Eventually, Nigel caught on to the fact that 30% the potential Apophite files you were offering were meant purely to annoy him-but when you explained your reasoning behind joining #Ammit, he didn't kick you out. Rather, he bought you a flight to LA, and showed you the conquered base of a Dark cult called the Sodality of the Harpuiai, who he told you were why he didn't allow the self-righteous kind of troll in. After reading their records (and you took a few stomache pills), you agreed with the policy. You're still more about pranks than justice, but you are more mythical trickster than IT malcontent, now-you have a method beyond mere amusement. You're also, ironically, the adult in the room a lot of the time-you don't have as extreme a grudge, and your Apophite specialty are the kind of people who think themselves being the real victims, even as they're sacrificing people who dare to have a whiter smile than they do to alien gods. You know how seductive hate gets.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T17:38:23-07:00","id":1085962,"title":"","content":"Thank you^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T10:42:31-07:00","id":1086251,"title":"","content":"I have another, shorter one.<br /> <br /> <i>You're like the Hulk: always angry at something. So you were a perfect Stormite for so long. But then that explosion happened. You were trapped under that rubble with the cold, bloody evidence of the consequences of your actions surrounding you for 3 days before you were finally found. And that's what it took you to see where Storms had lead you. Now you sneak into buildings to grab evidence instead of family members and plant bugs instead of bombs. The rage is still there, you just hope you've figured out how to focus it.</i><br /> <br /> Pretty simple, I know, but a start that other people can build on I hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 05-01-2017, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T12:11:41-07:00","id":1086280,"title":"","content":"Perfect. Adding it. And it being a bit shorter actually is a good thing^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T19:22:09-07:00","id":1086430,"title":"","content":"<i>You were falsely accused of heinous crimes. Even after you called in some favors and had some &quot;friends&quot; get the charges dropped and your name cleared, you received death threats and harassment from self-righteous net crusaders. You thought your life was over, ruined, by people you'd never met and who wouldn't even give you the benefit of the doubt. Then #Ammit dispensed its own justice on your persecutors. They believed you were still innocent. Now you are doing what you can to pay them back. Even if it means talking to your friends in the... less than fully human circles. </i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 05-02-2017, 08:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T05:42:02-07:00","id":1086569,"title":"","content":"Well, finally we have three hunter examples for #Ammit. Another section done!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T11:01:35-07:00","id":1086713,"title":"","content":"What is left?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T11:33:52-07:00","id":1086720,"title":"","content":"I admit I am not sure at this point. We have a chapter describing lore, a section exploring the relationships between the Hopeful and the various Compacts/Conspiracies, three new Compacts, three new Conspiracies, Supernatural merits, new Endowments, rules to play Princesses and the Darkness in a Hunter game and sample characters. I think pretty much everything that was essential has been covered. Maybe add a few new Endowments, since so far there are only like one or two per category?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T11:34:33-07:00","id":1086721,"title":"","content":"editing and revising for flow and word choice then?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T14:55:49-07:00","id":1086810,"title":"","content":"Yep, but we're already doing that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T15:42:35-07:00","id":1086837,"title":"","content":"Art? Any artists interested?<br /> <br /> Chapter fiction?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T15:48:10-07:00","id":1086839,"title":"","content":"Aaaah, right, I knew I had forgotten something^^ A few more chapter fictions would be welcome.<br /> <br /> As for art, well, I guess that could be nice, but i don't think we have many artists available...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T16:38:14-07:00","id":1086870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darinas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1086839#post1086839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aaaah, right, I knew I had forgotten something^^ A few more chapter fictions would be welcome.<br /> <br /> As for art, well, I guess that could be nice, but i don't think we have many artists available...</div> </div> </div> </div>My mom is a pretty decent artist. I can give you her e-mail if you want to see if she's interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T16:53:15-07:00","id":1086879,"title":"","content":"I have a few ideas for Compact &amp; Conspiracy icons. I can doodle them down but I'm a terrible artist. <br /> <br /> I could take a crack at an opening chapter fiction too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T17:43:47-07:00","id":1086898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I have a few ideas for Compact &amp; Conspiracy icons. I can doodle them down but I'm a terrible artist.<br /> <br /> I could take a crack at an opening chapter fiction too. </div> </div> </div>Both would be nice^^<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> My mom is a pretty decent artist. I can give you her e-mail if you want to see if she's interested. </div> </div> </div>I appreciate the offer, but I wouldn't want to disturb your mother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T06:22:11-07:00","id":1087128,"title":"","content":"Okay, upon checking a second time, there IS something that's still incomplete: the Story hook sections. If anyone has ideas regarding this, I am opened to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:09:06-07:00","id":1087167,"title":"","content":"Union or night Watch or some other community protection compact is under attack by a crafty Storms using the legal system to get their neighborhood bulldozed. <br /> <br /> A Nakama of Nobles has broken into and freed all the prisoners in your region's Malleus Malleficarum torture cellar. Now it's your job to track down the escapees and recapture them before they hurt anyone else. But do they really need to be caught?<br /> <br /> Alhambra has teamed up with the God-Machine to better protect both of their operations in a small town. This cannot be good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T10:44:59-07:00","id":1087225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1087167#post1087167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Alhambra has teamed up with the God-Machine to better protect both of their operations in a small town. This cannot be good.</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe you mean a group representing the Court of Tears has teamed up with a God Machine Cult. That way an actual alliance would be possible, and perhaps both camps would actually sympathize and have mutual respect for one another.<br /> <br /> If they tried talking to the Machine directly then they would be very disappointed to discover that it's impossible (and probably would have to run from Guardian Angels.)<br /> <br /> And if they tried negotiating with an Angel it would really result in a case by case basis since the Angel will always prioritize it's mission and would be just as likely to re-purpose the Nobles as dreamless Stigmatic sleeper agents for later uses than actually help them. Really depends if Tear's help or recycling would optimize the specific Occult Matrix the Machine is building in that unique instance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 05-03-2017, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T11:11:34-07:00","id":1087237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1087225#post1087225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I believe you mean a group representing the Court of Tears has teamed up with a God Machine Cult. That way an actual alliance would be possible, and perhaps both camps would actually sympathize and have mutual respect for one another.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that's much better. Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 05-03-2017, 02:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T13:45:39-07:00","id":1087325,"title":"","content":"Moar story hooks:<br /> <br /> A friend of yours recently moved away without telling you. You've tried to contact him and see how he's doing, but he seems to have dropped everything from his bank account to his cell phone plan. Now, you just saw someone who looked like his teenage daughter around the neighborhood just as a spike in monster attacks has occurred. It's up to your cell to figure out just what's going on; and little Jenny might just be your only lead.<br /> <br /> (I assume no one familiar with 