 too or are they just high off their ass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17107-mangaholic13","name":"Mangaholic13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-29T17:09:03-07:00","id":1145393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangaholic13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1145338#post1145338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How about a group of hunters attacking a Darkened, when a Princess shows up to save the Darkened, scolds the Hunters and then leaves. One Hunter (either an Ascended One or Ashwood Abbey) then asks the rest of the cell if they saw that too or are they just high off their ass.</div> </div> </div> </div>Illuminated Brotherhood, instead (everyone forgets about them, and they <i>are</i> druggies in their portrayal). And have a short epilogue showing the Darkened commit some more heinous crime later - no one says the Princess's faith in humanity has to be rewarded, after all, especial in a Hunter book. And it will help foster impressions of Nobles as potential enemies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link"