now<br /> <br /> makes me think they do want someone they could rough up.<br /> <br /> oh is it my imagination or will most of the groups in this project NOT work well with each other at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-18-2018, 06:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T17:33:26-07:00","id":1223440,"title":"","content":"Soooo looking back at the supplement, I remembered the People's Guard still don't have Factions. Which actually makes me wonder.... should have a faction inside their Conspiracy who would be.... how to put it.... less hateful toward Noble?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11745-darinas","name":"Darinas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11745_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T17:47:39-07:00","id":1223445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darinas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1072110-hunter-the-vigil-supplement-for-princesses?p=1223440#post1223440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soooo looking back at the supplement, I remembered the People's Guard still don't have Factions. Which actually makes me wonder.... should have a faction inside their Conspiracy who would be.... how to put it.... less hateful toward Noble?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Burn <i>all</i> the Bourgeoisie!</li> <li>Supernatural against Supernatural is fine, Supernatural against mortal is not.</li> <li>Infiltrate the Nobles to use them to the People's advantage, then eliminate them when no longer needed.</li> </ol>1 is pretty much as presented. 2 would be fine with Princesses, as long as they kept their powers to facing other monsters/supernaturals - but they minute they use advanced/magical skills on people, they are next in line for The Madame. 3 <i>seems</i> friendly, but only see Princesses as a lesser evil to use to the People's ends, then ending the threat of their power themselves (or selling them off to the Magisters).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 05-31-2018, 10:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T19:12:42-07:00","id":1223475,"title":"","content":"is the story too wordy, was trying to create a context for the well meaning, but heartbreaking, betrayal. it did sprawl more then I planned... not sure how to condense it.<br /> <br /> Reposted it here<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">C<i>hristina sighed and looked down. She did not fear her iminent death, in spite of being pretty much , she was a princess, blessed by the Queen of Diamonds, a Grace, she did not fear death, she almost welcomed it, the peace of death.</i><br /> <br /> <i>But she could not, would not take another innocent with her.</i><br /> <br /> <i>He\u2026 he was young, and had a lot of potential</i><br /> <br /> <i>Kelby, was a 9 year old Troubadour of Hearts always ready with grand tales, of courage and romance.</i><br /> <br /> <i>He didnt really understand death at his age, and she didnt fancy him gaining too intimate an understanding.</i><br /> <br /> <i>She thought of him she\u2019d trained him as best she could taught him formality and protocol as best as she understood it. Along with ways to combat the darkness, Using physical violence or diplomacy or occultism. Teaching him and when to use all of the above.</i><br /> <br /> <i>It had brought out the mother in her as well as the general.</i><br /> <br /> <i>And today she was thinking as a mother not a general.</i><br /> <br /> <i>The last month they\u2019d been tracking a mighty Cataphract down. He seemed to be the local general of the Darkness And needed taken out, at least that would ensure any more darkspawn attacks were uncoordinated and performed only out of base instincts,rather then part of any strategy, people would die yes and that was tragic, but it was better then the darkness conducting a strategic war in the region.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <i>She accepted it was a suicide mission not with despair or even resignation but would not let kelby\u2019s life be ended with her\u2019s</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <i>she had thought of the optians to find another hopeful who she\u2019d trust with the dutie\u2019s of De Facto guardian of a boy like kelby she would have to leave the city.</i><br /> <i>Allowing the cataphract to engage who knows what kinds of evil.</i><br /> <i>The vampires and m ages she trusted not at all.</i><br /> <br /> <i>The only choice\u2026 she hated herself for even thinking of for a half second\u2026 she already felt the telltale warning of sensitivity just from thinking it\u2026</i><br /> <br /> <i>but it was the only path to his survival</i><br /> <br /> <i>************** ******</i><br /> <br /> <i>The 3 of them had worked hard to make things work</i><br /> <br /> <i>They were undermanned and underfunded\u2026 But they worked tirelessly to protect children from all danger\u2019s.</i><br /> <br /> <i>They had a strong sense of right and wrong but werent philosopher\u2019s</i><br /> <br /> <i>Justin was a gifted investigator, Rodrigo, handled the bulk of combat, Melissa tended the Mundane front for their cell And tended to be their spokes person.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Christina sighed, she felt the telltale hint of Kelby\u2019s presence She had told him they needed to launch an all out attack\u2026 he trusted her she thought sadly and well he shouldnt.</i><br /> <br /> <i>They were hiding on the ceiling ready to jump down and try scaring these loser\u2019s out of town\u2026 or so he thought.</i><br /> <br /> <i>He was waiting for her to go in She usualy took the lead making him Follow from the sidelines Wanting him \u201cKept safe\u201d so he was surprised and delighted when she invited him to charge in harrying away these fool\u2019s reasoning his talent for music should be enough</i><br /> <br /> <i>She sighed she wished it would have a chance but the Well meaning fool\u2019s were looking more puzzled then anything.</i><br /> <br /> <i>he\u2019d gone down and was using inspire to try making them know what fools they were.</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <i>She came down two behind him he smiled knowing she was there to back him up\u2026</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <i>He knew wrong</i><br /> <br /> <i>She gathered her resolve and with one motion grabbed the ring from his finger with one swift motion</i><br /> <br /> <i>he screamed in pain and betrayal as he forcefully detransformed</i><br /> <br /> <i>They blinked</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cWhat is going on?</i><br /> <br /> <i>Christina sighed feeling the shadow\u2019s born of her betrayal of a member of her Nakama who had trusted her</i><br /> <br /> <i>Even in death this stain will follow me she thought acridly. Feeling her sensitivity flare\u2026 she could still make it right all it would cost was letting kelby put himself in deadly danger\u2019s</i><br /> <i>What are you his mother? Some internal censor criticized her.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Let him put himself in whatever danger he see\u2019s fit you\u2019ve already instructed him for 2 year\u2019s he lives or he dies, why should you worry overmuch about it, all too often its a hopeful\u2019s fate.</i><br /> <br /> <i>She shook her head she\u2019d come this far she couldnt second guess herself.</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cWe\u2019ve investigated a monster for week\u2019s that need\u2019s to be taken out, for year\u2019s I\u2019ve been in de Facto guardianship of him, his own parents dont know he\u2019s a royal. Even if they did, I dont think they could keep him safe\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>she handed the ring to them with a sigh</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cTake this its his phylactery\u201d she shook her head</i><br /> <br /> <i>Dumbfounded justin accepted it locking it away in a safe.</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cEventually he\u2019ll be able to recover it, and escape, but it will take weeks or months\u201d she said</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cand maybe longer if you keep him occupied and make him not want to escape too soon\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Melissa began firmly</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cYoung lady while we appreciate your desire to keep him safe if you think were going to let you go out to get killed-\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Christina shook her head \u201cI have another thing coming? I think we both know your not ready to subdue me on this short of notice\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>they sighed unfortunately she was right</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cI hate you!\u201d kelby blubbered \u201cI hate you!!! I hate you!!! dont you see I want the honor of dieing for my queen\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Christina shook her head sadly</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cSomeday I am sure you will have that privilege of dieing for your queen, but I\u2019ve put it off for a few years, only one of us need\u2019s to die today Pluss I want your death to have meaning ok sweetheart?\u201d she said with a tenderness the 3 onlooker\u2019s found difficult to understand since they had bizzare views on the hopeful.\u201dfor your death to have meaning you have to learn study grow\u2026 and become\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>She looked at him with sadness \u201cI know what I\u2019ve done, regardless of my motivation is unforgivable\u201d she said with a sigh. \u201cBut I want you to live to adulthood</i><br /> <br /> <i>as she was saying this Rodrigo was reaching for something some kind of weapon or alarm</i><br /> <br /> <i>she glanced at him and commanded him to kneel and he could not help but obey.</i><br /> <br /> <i>She looked to kelby one last time with maternal affection and sighed \u201cI had best be on my wat\u201d she said \u201cAgain one day you will die for your queen\u201d She assured him and jumped out. Of the building</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cShe used us\u201d Rodrigo snarled \u201cShe used us as a dumping ground for another sensitive she didnt want running underfoot\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Justin nodded \u201cIts such a shame, she so rationally contemplates dangers to another\u2019s life And tried to prevent them\u201d shook his head \u201cBut her own life was just an asset of her queen\u2019s to dispose of as she saw fit\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Melissa shook her head</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cSomehow I think she just wanted him to mature enough so his death can have some meaning remember what she told him\u201d</i><br /> <br /> <i>Justin shook his head</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cHopefully, by the time he grow\u2019s up their wont be a queen to die for anymore\u201d</i></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-30-2018, 10:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[